eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882040/extras/337f24468796133973fe75a61f3e5a1f.webm?t=1727408478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882040/extras/337f24468796133973fe75a61f3e5a1f.mp4?t=1727408478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat the Dark Lord, enter Desert, Tundra and other new bios, adapt your base accordingly and conquer more lands!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882040/extras/a2b2d99c8e8c5f0f3a1949dcb8f1edf0.poster.avif?t=1727408478\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882040/extras/a2b2d99c8e8c5f0f3a1949dcb8f1edf0.webm?t=1727408478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882040/extras/a2b2d99c8e8c5f0f3a1949dcb8f1edf0.mp4?t=1727408478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between Archer, Warrior and Mage, create your build with dual weapons, talent and mercenaries.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882040/extras/e35350c856f6bb04954ccfdba87ceb15.poster.avif?t=1727408478\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882040/extras/e35350c856f6bb04954ccfdba87ceb15.webm?t=1727408478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882040/extras/e35350c856f6bb04954ccfdba87ceb15.mp4?t=1727408478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
